import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 397 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Energy-Waste Analysis: Controller-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Transcendence","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 397 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Energy-Waste Analysis: Controller-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Transcendence","no":397,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Energy Waste","Controller","Lone-Path Cultivation"],"related":["15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law","24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0397_模块2-莽荒纪-能级浪费解析-掌控者级资质用于个人超脱.md","filePath":"en/0397_模块2-莽荒纪-能级浪费解析-掌控者级资质用于个人超脱.md"}'),s={name:"en/0397_模块2-莽荒纪-能级浪费解析-掌控者级资质用于个人超脱.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,u,c){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-397-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-energy-waste-analysis-controller-tier-aptitude-used-for-personal-transcendence" tabindex="-1">Entry 397 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Energy-Waste Analysis: Controller-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Transcendence <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-397-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-energy-waste-analysis-controller-tier-aptitude-used-for-personal-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 397 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Energy-Waste Analysis: Controller-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Transcendence&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 15, 24, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-pour-a-whole-cosmos-s-energy-into-one-person-s-dao-seeking-path" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Pour a whole cosmos&#39;s energy into one person&#39;s Dao-seeking path <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-pour-a-whole-cosmos-s-energy-into-one-person-s-dao-seeking-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Pour a whole cosmos&#39;s energy into one person&#39;s Dao-seeking path&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones not ascend alone but carry Myriad Ranks forward; anti-energy waste is this module&#39;s mandatory core. This entry specializes in Manghuang&#39;s most glaring energy misallocation — <strong>Controller-tier aptitude and resources systemically invested in the single goal of &quot;Ji Ning&#39;s personal transcendence.&quot;</strong> The law-first axiom reminds: assessing energy direction must not be kidnapped by &quot;I-Eat-Tomatoes-style thrill rhythm,&quot; but by whether resources sediment into civilization-level stock. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium (lone-path-cultivation-style civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Manghuang&#39;s energy waste is the most exaggerated among Myriad-Realms benchmark samples, at least four layers:</p><ul><li><strong>Aptitude layer</strong>: Ji Ning is born with divine-demonic bloodline, simultaneously cultivating body and qi; this &quot;dual-system compatibility sample&quot; should have been a cosmos-level research topic, replicable and generalizable, yet compressed into one person&#39;s leveling engine</li><li><strong>Resource layer</strong>: body-refining must devour fierce beasts, refine divine-demonic bodies; qi-refining must seize cave-heavens blessed lands, devour heaven-earth qi. The same person eats two resource lines, consumption two to three times an ordinary cultivator&#39;s, and demand expands exponentially the higher the tier</li><li><strong>Lifespan layer</strong>: from Return-to-Void to Eternal Sovereign often counted in hundred-thousand epochs; Ji Ning&#39;s long lifespan is almost all used for &quot;next instance, next treasure, next realm,&quot; not writing books, establishing institutions, teaching disciples</li><li><strong>Ultimate layer</strong>: after ascending Controller, spacetime reversal, cosmos rebirth power&#39;s first use is resurrecting Yu Wei — this private grand wish exhausts Controller-tier energy&#39;s first large-scale release</li></ul><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s words: this is connecting an entire galaxy&#39;s electricity to one person&#39;s flashlight.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How energy waste directly manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Resources linearly drained</strong>: the dual-system route&#39;s extraction of cave-heavens, spirit veins, fierce-beast materials is doubled; after a domain is drained dry by Ji Ning&#39;s road, later generations&#39; cultivation threshold rises multiple times</li><li><strong>Experience zero-sedimentation</strong>: hundred-thousand epochs of Dao-comprehension all in Ji Ning&#39;s single brain; no textbooks, no network, no instance for others to verify</li><li><strong>Ultimate energy not refluxed</strong>: if Controller power could feed back laws and universal-benefit Myriad Ranks, civilization could jump a tier overall; in reality it is locked into the private task of &quot;saving one person&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ji Ning&#39;s predatory thinking concentrates in the &quot;dual-system privilege&quot; narrative:</p><ul><li><strong>&quot;I want both roads&quot;</strong>: body-refiners envy qi-refining&#39;s lightness, qi-refiners envy body-refining&#39;s solidity; only Ji Ning has both &quot;adventure + comprehension,&quot; equal to declaring the two best solutions are his</li><li><strong>Instance-exclusive logic</strong>: Fangcun Mountain, Star-Picking Pavilion, secret-realm inheritances all &quot;first-come-first-served, strength wins all&quot;; never imagined instances open, Myriad Ranks cultivate together</li><li><strong>Transmigrator energy arbitrage</strong>: past-life memory brings mind and vision advantage; in the Manghuang world it is pure incremental gain, yet no reflux mechanism compensates the cosmos</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Energy Direction</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Energy Direction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dual-system compatibility sample to Ji Ning alone</td><td>Body and qi dual-path research public; Myriad Ranks differentiated choice</td></tr><tr><td>Cave-heavens spirit veins doubly drained to feed the top</td><td>Resource allocation jointly contracted; 20% activation strategy broadly cultivates the middle</td></tr><tr><td>Hundred-thousand-epoch lifespan used to farm instances and break realms</td><td>Strong-one post-duty system; lifespan must sediment into textbooks and institutions</td></tr><tr><td>Controller power first used to save one person</td><td>Resurrection-class spacetime laws require Alaya approval; energy universal-benefited before private affection</td></tr><tr><td>Transmigrator freely arbitrages</td><td>Causal self-discipline: return only knowledge, do not disturb native causality</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Manghuang&#39;s &quot;dual-system resource-demand curve&quot; and Three-Realms–Chaos-Immortal-Realm total resource stock</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;Ji Ning alone swallows dual systems,&quot; &quot;dual-system resources averaged over one generation,&quot; &quot;Anchor-Symbiosis institutions injected&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: civilization&#39;s overall average energy, Law-Origin / Dao-Origin tier middle-tier success rate, post-calamity recovery speed</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — the resources Ji Ning personally consumes to peak, under a symbiotic scheme could mass-support a middle-tier group; energy utilization differs by nearly two orders of magnitude</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Dual-system resource demand expands exponentially with realm; early &quot;one stone-milk enough to change fate,&quot; late &quot;treasure mountain burned as firewood&quot;</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Controller-tier abilities later blow more and more mystical; spacetime reversal&#39;s cost almost zero; early &quot;life-death matter&quot; constraints become nominal</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. Lone-path cultivation style — civilization energy direction hinges on Ji Ning&#39;s personal road</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: four-fold waste — aptitude, resources, lifespan, ultimate energy</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: &quot;I want both shares of resources&quot; structural privilege narrative</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo uses energy to systematically universal-benefit humankind; Ji Ning uses energy for personal transcendence and private obsession — energy direction more private</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: dual-system research not opened; Myriad Ranks&#39; qualification even to choose which road is monopolized</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: resources closed zero-sum, no &quot;develop increment&quot; consciousness</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy waste is not Ji Ning&#39;s moral stain, but the inevitable product of lone-path cultivation&#39;s &quot;one person peaks = civilization wins&quot; logic. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s proposition is hard: Controller-tier aptitude is the whole cosmos&#39;s public asset, not some one person&#39;s dantian fuel — no matter how affectionate or hardworking that person is.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · energy-waste analysis · Controller-tier aptitude used for personal transcendence described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./396_模块2-莽荒纪-总论纪宁与孤道修仙体系定性.html">Entry 396 · Overview</a> · <a href="./398_模块2-莽荒纪-历史倒退必然性-大能陨落文明即断代.html">Entry 398 · Inevitable Historical Regression</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=i(s,[["render",a]]);export{h as __pageData,m as default};
